        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 2:47PM AKDT until September 26 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Coastal Waters Forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...S wind 25 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.SAT...S wind 20 kt. Seas 6 ft. Rain showers.
.SAT NIGHT...S wind 20 kt. Seas 6 ft. Rain showers.
.SUN...SW wind 20 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.SUN NIGHT...W wind 15 kt. Seas 4 ft.
.MON THROUGH TUE...W wind 20 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.WED...NW wind 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
</description>
